text I am running.
text It is already 11.
text And that is exactly when I promised to meet up with Fujibayashi.
text I'm late!
text I frantically run.
text I couldn't care less when it comes to being late to school. However, when it comes to going on a date, that of course isn't going to fly.
text Moreover, this is only our second date and the first time it'll be just the two of us.
text Every time my feet hit the ground the paper bag I am holding rattles.
text Inside are the tarot cards that Kyou gave me the day before yesterday.
text And in my shirt pocket is the pendant I bought yesterday─
text ...Or not!
text Crap! I forgot it!
text There isn't time for me to run back to fetch it. Dammit!
text Guess all I'm giving her today is the tarot cards!
