text Even so, we've already gone to all the places of note around here today.
text In the end, there just isn't "anywhere" we can go to.
text And so we just keep on walking while holding hands.
text She walks slowly, so as to lengthen the time we have together even by just a little.
text And I match her footsteps...
text Time flows by gradually...
text Even if I close my eyes, I can feel through her warmth that she's next to me. It gives me a sense of comfort and tranquility that words cannot describe.
text Then, suddenly, I can feel a light tug on my arm.
