text Before long, all the planets have completely disappeared and the sun, which has remained, now draws near us.
text The sun accelerates, expanding its coverage of pixels on the monitor, and along with it turns the screen white.
text The screen fades into a scene of shooting stars streaming across the night sky.
text Then, the names which we entered earlier appear on the screen.
text Furthermore, words...
text The results are out.
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's see...
text Fujibayashi and I stare at the screen at the same time.
text Our faces are close, but without minding that fact a single bit, our eyes remain fixed on the monitor.
text ...Am I being overly conscious...?
text "This week, it seems the two of you will come into conflict due to minor trifles."
text "You, who approaches everything seriously, may think that your partner as irresponsible for tending to beat around the bush."
text "However, you should refrain from imposing your opinions on others."
text "By stepping into your partner's shoes, you should be able to find things that you can learn from your partner."
text "You should also try to be bolder. Instead of using the telephone, try to increase the opportunities you talk to each other in person."
text "Your lucky items are: Umbrella and chocolates."
text "Your lucky color is: Blue."
text @[Tomoya]
text ...These sure are dodgy results.
sound ADF.aac
text @[Ryou]
text Yes... they are.
text As we glare at the screen, the text on it slowly fades away.
text Meanwhile, the cabinet prints out the results.
text The two of us reach for it at the same time.
text Our faces get very close.
