text "If you let the chance slip away, it'll just get harder to do later on."
text Chance...?
text What's my chance...?
text When's my chance...?
text How about the situation we are in right now...? Does this work?
text Our faces are so close...
text There's this mysterious background music playing...
text And we're in this space all by ourselves, separated from the outside world by the curtain.
text I instinctively place my hands on Fujibayashi's shoulders.
