label s24
text For a moment, I recall what I did with Kyou the day before yesterday...
text But─
text This isn't practice...
label 24
text I grip tighter.
text A girl's shoulders... really are soft for how slender they are...
text I can feel the warmth seeping through her clothes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Fujibayashi...
sound ADN.aac
text @[Ryou]
text ...
text Following the lead of my words and glances, Fujibayashi clams her lips together.
