text Then, gently, her eyes do the same as well...
text This is the signal...
text It's the proof that we've come to the point where we can no longer stop...
text Slowly, I close my eyes as well, and move toward her face.
text I notice that the noise around us has all but faded.
text All I can feel is the warmth in the area where we are touching...
sound ADO.aac
text @[Ryou]
text Mm...
text Our lips gently press against each other's.
text I can feel that my heart is pounding my chest heavily.
text My mind is turning completely blank...
text To the point that I forget even to breathe, and all I can do is stay still with our lips locked together.
text Then ─ it's a little ambiguous as to who moved away first ─ our lips separate.
