text ...It was... my first one...
text Tears begin to flow out of her eyes.
text @[Tomoya]
text F-Fujibayashi?!
text Seeing her tearing up makes me feel as if I was hit in the back of the head by a blunt instrument.
text I am feeling rather anxious.
text @[Tomoya]
text Um... I'm sorry... I was only thinking about myself...
