text I'm happy that... you kissed me, Okazaki-kun...
sound AE0.aac
text @[Ryou]
text I'm really... happy...
text Fujibayashi looks happy yet embarrassed while tears drip down her face.
text Seeing her acting like that calms me down.
text The joy of being needed by someone.
text The happiness of being able to give someone joy...
text It's very trivial... yet at the same time it's very important...
text It feels as if it is something that will shine brightly in the future.
setvar intF[312] = 1
