label s28
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah...
text Very close to each other, our eyes meet.
text It weighs heavily on me when I notice how her eyes are filled with anxiety.
text Crap... this atmosphere...
text Right away, my enthusiasm is all but gone.
text The hands that I had placed on Fujibayashi's slender shoulders let go.
text Instead, I take the paper that the  fortune telling results were printed on, and straighten myself.
text @[Tomoya]
text Here.
