text There sits a neatly packaged bag.
text It's the pendant I bought yesterday...
text To think that I forgot about it, even though I had placed it somewhere so obvious...
text ...Well... it's fine. I can give it to her any time.
text If I had given her both things at once, it might've just bothered Fujibayashi all the more.
text After all, she was already so thrilled to get just the tarot cards.
